{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "El gaucho Mart\u00edn Fierro",
    "steam_appid": 3610780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an interactive adaptation of <i>El gaucho Mart\u00edn Fierro</i>. Through various minigames, the player will discover the story of the legendary gaucho, narrated in verses taken directly from the original work. Each level offers a different mechanic, from rhythm challenges and skill-based tests to duels and puzzles, reflecting different moments of Fierro's journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be accessible to all types of players. The mechanics are simple and easy to learn, allowing anyone to immerse themselves in the story without difficulty barriers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual style aims to convey the simplicity, and even the harshness, of life in the Argentine pampas in the mid-19th century. With an aesthetic inspired by literature and gaucho folklore, the graphics evoke the feeling of being inside the pages of a book.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i> is filled with tragedy, injustice, and struggle, but also with wisdom and reflection. As the game progresses, the verses narrate the life of the wandering gaucho, his confrontations with authority, his losses, and his quest for freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed in about 1 hour. More than an extensive challenge, it is a short experience designed as a gateway to the story of <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i>. If it sparks your curiosity about the original work, then it has fulfilled its purpose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Literary Adaptation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the verses in the game are taken directly from the original work. Although, for obvious reasons, a large part of the text has been omitted, the essence of the story remains intact. This game is not only a tribute to <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i> but also a way to bring its legacy to new generations through interactivity.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an interactive adaptation of <i>El gaucho Mart\u00edn Fierro</i>. Through various minigames, the player will discover the story of the legendary gaucho, narrated in verses taken directly from the original work. Each level offers a different mechanic, from rhythm challenges and skill-based tests to duels and puzzles, reflecting different moments of Fierro's journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be accessible to all types of players. The mechanics are simple and easy to learn, allowing anyone to immerse themselves in the story without difficulty barriers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual style aims to convey the simplicity, and even the harshness, of life in the Argentine pampas in the mid-19th century. With an aesthetic inspired by literature and gaucho folklore, the graphics evoke the feeling of being inside the pages of a book.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i> is filled with tragedy, injustice, and struggle, but also with wisdom and reflection. As the game progresses, the verses narrate the life of the wandering gaucho, his confrontations with authority, his losses, and his quest for freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed in about 1 hour. More than an extensive challenge, it is a short experience designed as a gateway to the story of <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i>. If it sparks your curiosity about the original work, then it has fulfilled its purpose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Literary Adaptation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the verses in the game are taken directly from the original work. Although, for obvious reasons, a large part of the text has been omitted, the essence of the story remains intact. This game is not only a tribute to <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i> but also a way to bring its legacy to new generations through interactivity.</p>",
    "short_description": "Live the odyssey of Mart\u00edn Fierro in a journey full of unique challenges. Master the rhythm of the guitar, face duels, and survive nature by challenging the wind and the wild fauna, while the legend of the gaucho comes to life through the verses of the epic 19th-century novel.",
